OtohaChatApp
============

This application is an independent host for SwiftAgent. It does not vendor
SwiftAgent sources. The SDK is consumed as a remote Swift package pinned to
SwiftAgent 1.0.0-rc.3 (git revision d5383a26849f45d8a442c24aebfb0b7ca4798dd5).

