Adapted example code
--------------------
The conversation controller, snapshot projection, fixture provider, and
execution-report reducer in Sources/OtohaChatKit/Conversation are adapted from:

  SwiftAgent/Examples/AppleChatApp
  Files:
    Sources/AppleChatIntegration/ConversationController.swift
    Sources/AppleChatIntegration/ConversationDisplay.swift
    Sources/AppleChatIntegration/FixtureConversation.swift

  SwiftAgent/Examples/ExecutionReportingSupport
  Files:
    Sources/ExecutionReportingSupport/ExecutionReportReducer.swift

The fixture path is test/preview/demo only. Ordinary user chat never falls
back to the fixture. The execution report is presentation data only; restoring
it cannot authorize a tool or mutate a Journal.

OtohaChatApp is not affiliated with OpenAI, Anthropic, DeepSeek, or Apple
Intelligence product brands. Provider names appear only as configuration
labels for the corresponding APIs.
